      <activity id="e3a1fd60-3fff-5f0c-83bf-79c7c82f09d4" activityNameId="ba2d1637-b946-58fd-80ba-92fd8896e0a9" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electronics for control units</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electronics for control units
The control unit has a composition of 46% steel (housing), 32% plastics, 14% printed wiring boards and 8% cables (various types).; UUID: c8b24e02-0143-3bd2-ac59-dae790a0451e
This module includes the composition of a typical control unit for devices in the industry. Included are the materials of the different components (housing, cables, mounted PWB). Not included are the final production efforts out of the components to the control unit.
Location: Data used has no specific geographical origin (literature values). In 2023, no major updates are implemented for this dataset, except for the use of updated ICT datasets in the background/inventory, e.g. cables and printed wiring boards.
Technology: estimated composition of the electronics for control units in the industry, based on literature
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: Unknown
Sampling: own estimations &amp; literature
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c8b24e02-0143-3bd2-ac59-dae790a0451e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
